166 0 obj
<</Type/StructElem/S/H3/P 64 0 R/T(For 1200 to 1530, consumption is 330. For 65400 to 120, the difference wraps modulo 65536: 120 \212 65400 = \21265280; modulo 65536 gives 256. It is not negative because conversion to the unsigned 16-bit type wraps into the range 0\20565535. A 16-bit unsigned register changes from 65535 to 0. Integer paise additions remain exact; float additions can accumulate approximation error.)/E(For 1200 to 1530, consumption is 330. For 65400 to 120, the difference wraps modulo 65536: 120 \212 65400 = \21265280; modulo 65536 gives 256. It is not negative because conversion to the unsigned 16-bit type wraps into the range 0\20565535. A 16-bit unsigned register changes from 65535 to 0. Integer paise additions remain exact; float additions can accumulate approximation error.)/Pg 12 0 R/K[21]>>
endobj

