248 0 obj
<</Type/StructElem/S/H3/P 68 0 R/T(The preprocessor replaces macro calls with their replacement text before compilation. SQUARE\(x\) written as x*x gives an incorrect expansion for SQUARE\(a+1\), because operator precedence changes the meaning. The safe form is \(\(x\)*\(x\)\). MAX may evaluate an argument more than once, so expressions with side effects such as i++ should not be passed. A normal or static inline function gives type checking and evaluates each argument once.)/E(The preprocessor replaces macro calls with their replacement text before compilation. SQUARE\(x\) written as x*x gives an incorrect expansion for SQUARE\(a+1\), because operator precedence changes the meaning. The safe form is \(\(x\)*\(x\)\). MAX may evaluate an argument more than once, so expressions with side effects such as i++ should not be passed. A normal or static inline function gives type checking and evaluates each argument once.)/Pg 16 0 R/K[9]>>
endobj

