261 0 obj
<</Type/StructElem/S/H3/P 68 0 R/T(The output confirms 50 rupees becomes 5000 paise, SQUARE\(5\) is 25, and the maximum of 3 and 8 is 8. A macro is expanded at each use and may increase code size when used k times. An inline function may be inlined by the compiler or emitted once; both approaches have O\(1\) work for these operations. A non-inlined function can have call overhead.)/E(The output confirms 50 rupees becomes 5000 paise, SQUARE\(5\) is 25, and the maximum of 3 and 8 is 8. A macro is expanded at each use and may increase code size when used k times. An inline function may be inlined by the compiler or emitted once; both approaches have O\(1\) work for these operations. A non-inlined function can have call overhead.)/Pg 16 0 R/K[22]>>
endobj

