324 0 obj
<</Type/StructElem/S/H2/P 70 0 R/T(Normal compilation prints only the bill. Compilation with -DDEBUG also prints the intermediate units and paise value. With #ifdef, debug statements are removed from a normal build, so there is no run-time test. A run-time if\(debug\) keeps the condition and debug code in the executable, adding a small O\(1\) check per call.)/E(Normal compilation prints only the bill. Compilation with -DDEBUG also prints the intermediate units and paise value. With #ifdef, debug statements are removed from a normal build, so there is no run-time test. A run-time if\(debug\) keeps the condition and debug code in the executable, adding a small O\(1\) check per call.)/Pg 18 0 R/K[3]>>
