416 0 obj
<</Type/StructElem/S/H3/P 73 0 R/T(The preprocessor replaces RATE with 225 and inserts standard-header declarations. The assembly file contains processor instructions; the object file contains machine code; the executable is linked. A missing semicolon is a compile-time error, an undefined compute_bill reference is a link-time error, and invalid run-time input is handled by program validation. In a multi-file project, only a changed .c file needs recompilation if its header interface is unchanged; object files require additional disk space.)/E(The preprocessor replaces RATE with 225 and inserts standard-header declarations. The assembly file contains processor instructions; the object file contains machine code; the executable is linked. A missing semicolon is a compile-time error, an undefined compute_bill reference is a link-time error, and invalid run-time input is handled by program validation. In a multi-file project, only a changed .c file needs recompilation if its header interface is unchanged; object files require additional disk space.)/Pg 21 0 R/K[22]>>
endobj

