433 0 obj
<</Type/StructElem/S/H3/P 74 0 R/T(The meter is treated as a 16-bit unsigned register. A lower current reading may indicate rollover or invalid input. This demonstration accepts rollover only when the previous value is at least 60000 and current value is at most 5535. This is an explicit plausibility rule; a production system should use meter protocol information. The bill uses integer paise and progressive slabs.)/E(The meter is treated as a 16-bit unsigned register. A lower current reading may indicate rollover or invalid input. This demonstration accepts rollover only when the previous value is at least 60000 and current value is at most 5535. This is an explicit plausibility rule; a production system should use meter protocol information. The bill uses integer paise and progressive slabs.)/Pg 22 0 R/K[9]>>
endobj

