485 0 obj
<</Type/StructElem/S/H2/P 75 0 R/T(For 65400 to 120, consumption is 256 units. The energy charge is 56 \327 225 + 100 \327 450 = 57,600 paise; adding the fixed charge gives Rs 626.00. Boundary test bills are 0 units = Rs 50.00, 100 = Rs 50.00, 200 = Rs 275.00 and 350 = Rs 950.00. Five bills at 0, 100, 150, 200 and 350 units total Rs 1,487.50. Invalid letters, negative values and implausible decreases must be rejected. An array-and-loop tariff design takes O\(s\) time for s slabs and uses O\(s\) configuration space; fixed slab statements are O\(1\) and simpler for three fixed slabs.)/E(For 65400 to 120, consumption is 256 units. The energy charge is 56 \327 225 + 100 \327 450 = 57,600 paise; adding the fixed charge gives Rs 626.00. Boundary test bills are 0 units = Rs 50.00, 100 = Rs 50.00, 200 = Rs 275.00 and 350 = Rs 950.00. Five bills at 0, 100, 150, 200 and 350 units total Rs 1,487.50. Invalid letters, negative values and implausible decreases must be rejected. An array-and-loop tariff design takes O\(s\) time for s slabs and uses O\(s\) configuration space; fixed slab statements are O\(1\) and simpler for three fixed slabs.)/Pg 23 0 R/K[7]>>
endobj

