525 0 obj
<</Type/StructElem/S/H3/P 76 0 R/T(An individual bill and a district accumulator need different ranges. This experiment assumes a maximum bill of Rs 10,000, or 1,000,000 paise. At 800,000 bills the total is 800,000,000,000 paise, larger than a typical 32-bit int but within a 64-bit long long. float has about 24 bits of significand precision and double about 53; a large range does not guarantee exact paise. Integer addition and floating addition are O\(1\); typical float is 4 bytes and long long/double are 8 bytes.)/E(An individual bill and a district accumulator need different ranges. This experiment assumes a maximum bill of Rs 10,000, or 1,000,000 paise. At 800,000 bills the total is 800,000,000,000 paise, larger than a typical 32-bit int but within a 64-bit long long. float has about 24 bits of significand precision and double about 53; a large range does not guarantee exact paise. Integer addition and floating addition are O\(1\); typical float is 4 bytes and long long/double are 8 bytes.)/Pg 24 0 R/K[9]>>
endobj

