<</Type/StructElem/S/H3/P 77 0 R/T(Use a documented 16-bit meter type only when the hardware register is exactly 16-bit. Use wider unsigned integers for consumption, integer paise for currency, and long long/int64_t for district totals. Centralise tariffs in one header or validated configuration. Include guards protect headers. Use functions for calculations and avoid side-effecting macro arguments. Validate all inputs and check arithmetic bounds.)/E(Use a documented 16-bit meter type only when the hardware register is exactly 16-bit. Use wider unsigned integers for consumption, integer paise for currency, and long long/int64_t for district totals. Centralise tariffs in one header or validated configuration. Include guards protect headers. Use functions for calculations and avoid side-effecting macro arguments. Validate all inputs and check arithmetic bounds.)/Pg 25 0 R/K[9]>>
endobj

