608 0 obj
<</Type/StructElem/S/H3/P 79 0 R/T(The new system handles interval energy in Wh, timestamps and separate peak/off-peak totals. A 16-bit register cannot hold an illustrative annual energy of 35,040 kWh = 35,040,000 Wh. Use a 64-bit accumulator. The tariff values are read from tariff.cfg rather than compiled as #define values. Peak hours are 18:00 inclusive to 22:00 exclusive. The program assumes each record contains interval Wh, not a cumulative register reading.)/E(The new system handles interval energy in Wh, timestamps and separate peak/off-peak totals. A 16-bit register cannot hold an illustrative annual energy of 35,040 kWh = 35,040,000 Wh. Use a 64-bit accumulator. The tariff values are read from tariff.cfg rather than compiled as #define values. Peak hours are 18:00 inclusive to 22:00 exclusive. The program assumes each record contains interval Wh, not a cumulative register reading.)/Pg 27 0 R/K[8]>>
endobj

