668 0 obj
<</Type/StructElem/S/H2/P 80 0 R/T(There are 35,040 quarter-hour intervals in a year. At an illustrative 1 kWh per interval, annual energy is 35,040 kWh or 35,040,000 Wh, exceeding 65,535. The example has 1,000 Wh off-peak and 1,000 Wh peak. At 225 paise/kWh, the energy charge is Rs 4.95; adding Rs 50 fixed charge gives Rs 54.95. Processing r records takes O\(r\) time, with O\(1\) work per record. Reading t tariff values takes O\(t\) start-up time and O\(t\) space. A production version must check multiplication overflow and validate date/time-zone and meter semantics.)/E(There are 35,040 quarter-hour intervals in a year. At an illustrative 1 kWh per interval, annual energy is 35,040 kWh or 35,040,000 Wh, exceeding 65,535. The example has 1,000 Wh off-peak and 1,000 Wh peak. At 225 paise/kWh, the energy charge is Rs 4.95; adding Rs 50 fixed charge gives Rs 54.95. Processing r records takes O\(r\) time, with O\(1\) work per record. Reading t tariff values takes O\(t\) start-up time and O\(t\) space. A production version must check multiplication overflow and validate date/time-zone and meter semantics.)/Pg 28 0 R/K[6]>>
endobj

