endobj

1029 0 obj
<</Title(The recommended design uses integer paise, a wide district accumulator, central tariff definitions, safe functions and thorough validation. Production deployment still requires confirmed tariff rules and meter rollover metadata.)/Dest[26 0 R/Fit]/Parent 956 0 R>>
endobj

1030 0 obj
<</Title(Adapt the billing system for smart meters sending watt-hour readings every 15 minutes \(35,040 readings per household per year\), with a 20% surcharge from 6 PM to 10 PM and tariffs changeable without recompilation.)/Dest[27 0 R/Fit]/Parent 957 0 R>>
endobj

