1179 0 obj
<</Title(The preprocessor replaces macro calls with their replacement text before compilation. SQUARE\(x\) written as x*x gives an incorrect expansion for SQUARE\(a+1\), because operator precedence changes the meaning. The safe form is \(\(x\)*\(x\)\). MAX may evaluate an argument more than once, so expressions with side effects such as i++ should not be passed. A normal or static inline function gives type checking and evaluates each argument once.)/Dest[16 0 R/Fit]/Parent 1160 0 R>>
endobj

