<</Title(For input 1204 150, scanf assigns both values and the sample calculation prints Rs 387.50. If the first value is ABC, scanf returns 0 and the program prints an error. Using %d for a long is incorrect. An alternative is fgets\(\) followed by strtol\(\)/sscanf\(\); processing a line of length L takes O\(L\) time and O\(L\) buffer space, and makes it easier to discard an invalid line and recover.)/Dest[19 0 R/Fit]/Parent 1205 0 R>>
