<</Title(5/2 gives 2 because both operands are integers. 5/2.0 gives 2.50 because one operand is floating point. Repeated addition of 0.1f may print approximately 1.000000119 rather than exactly 1.0. Integer paise gives exactly 100 for ten additions of 10 paise. Casting a large long to int can lose information; choose a sufficiently wide destination instead.)/Dest[20 0 R/Fit]/Parent 1228 0 R>>
endobj

